[
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lower a probe into a tunnel dug right on the equator.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-00.wav",
    "seconds": 3.65,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 1,
    "text": "The Earth turns once every twenty-three point nine hours.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-01.wav",
    "seconds": 3.02,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 2,
    "text": "That carries the equator east at about sixteen hundred and seventy kilometres an hour.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-02.wav",
    "seconds": 4.6,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 3,
    "text": "That's the speed of the ground itself, right where the tunnel starts.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-03.wav",
    "seconds": 4.07,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 4,
    "text": "The probe is carried along with it, sideways.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-04.wav",
    "seconds": 2.81,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 5,
    "text": "It keeps that sideways speed as it falls.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-05.wav",
    "seconds": 2.71,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 6,
    "text": "But the rock deeper down is closer to the axis, so it's moving slower.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-06.wav",
    "seconds": 4.7,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 7,
    "text": "So the probe drifts sideways, faster than the wall beside it, and the gap keeps growing as it sinks.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-07.wav",
    "seconds": 6.38,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 8,
    "text": "And it scrapes the wall.",
    "file": "S58-sideways-wall/vo/cold-08.wav",
    "seconds": 1.76,
    "pauseAfter": 0.55,
    "estimated": true
  },
  {
    "scene": "cold",
    "index": 9,
    "text": "So where would you dig the tunnel, so the probe falls straight? The full video on our channel has the answer. Like and subscribe so you don't miss the next one.",
